<title>USA: Health Management forebearance extended.</title>
<headline>Health Management forebearance extended.</headline>
<dateline>BUFFALO GROVE, Ill. 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Health Management Inc said Tuesday the forebearance relating to its credit agreement and senior debt has been extended to January 10.</p>
<p>The extension was granted by Transworld Home HealthCare Inc, in connection with the company's plan to purchase 49 percent of Health Management. The deal is now expected to close January 10, Health Management said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787)).</p>
